{"check":"tls_ca","fails_when":"CURL_CA_BUNDLE/SSL_CERT_FILE points at a missing or non-file path, or an SSL_CERT_DIR entry is missing (fail — every HTTPS request would error); a configured proxy with no custom CA bundle warns — the corporate TLS-intercept case (runs under --offline)","remediation":"set CURL_CA_BUNDLE (or SSL_CERT_FILE/SSL_CERT_DIR) to your organization's PEM bundle, or fix/remove the missing path","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/troubleshooting.md#setup--config-problems--tau-doctor"}
